{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39715","headline":"延福里居和林宽何绍余醻寄 · 黄滔","name":"延福里居和林宽何绍余醻寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长说愁吟逆旅中，一庭深雪一窗风。\n眼前道路无心觅，象外烟霞有句通。\n几度相留侵鼓散，频闻会宿着僧同。\n高情未以干时废，属和因知兴不穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}